neakers, and carries an oversized rolling suitcase. Maintain consistent faces, hairstyles, clothing, and proportions throughout.\n\n**Scene:**\n\nThe woman stands near the airport security entrance, checking her phone and arranging her travel documents. The man rushes past, deliberately knocks her coffee out of her hand, and dismissively says, “Watch where you're standing.” Her coffee splashes across the floor as he smirks and continues walking.\n\nShe calmly watches him, picks up her fallen passport holder, and says, “You forgot something.”\n\nHe turns around with a mocking grin. She points toward his suitcase, whose extended handle has become tangled around a nearby airport luggage trolley. He laughs and gives the suitcase a hard pull, but the trolley rolls in the opposite direction, spinning him around and sending his suitcase sliding between two empty luggage carts.\n\nEmbarrassed, he rushes back toward her and angrily demands an apology. She steps aside at the last moment, and he stumbles onto a moving airport baggage conveyor's empty collection platform, landing safely on a pile of soft travel pillows. His suitcase follows behind him, popping open and scattering socks, shirts, and a ridiculous collection of stuffed toys across the platform.\n\nNearby travelers stop to watch. One elderly passenger raises an eyebrow, while another quietly records the scene on a phone.\n\nThe man scrambles to his feet, grabs his suitcase, and tries to storm away. Unfortunately, his jacket catches briefly on the luggage trolley handle. He pulls harder, sending the trolley rolling forward while he spins around and lands sitting on a padded airport bench.\n\nThe woman walks over, picks up one of his scattered stuffed toys, and places it neatly on his suitcase. She smiles and says, **“Maybe try traveling with some manners.”**\n\nAn airport employee approaches and gestures toward the mess. The man looks around at the laughing passengers, then reluctantly starts collecting his belongings while the woman calmly heads toward security.\n\n**Ending shot:** The camera follows her confident walk through the terminal. She glances back once, smiles at the camera, and disappears into the security queue as the embarrassed man struggles with his overloaded suitcase in the background.\n\n**Visual style:** Photorealistic live-action comedy, authentic Seoul airport terminal, natural overhead lighting, realistic crowd behavior, cinematic handheld camera, expressive facial close-ups, believable physical comedy, detailed luggage movement, natural motion blur, consistent character identity, realistic reflections, and clear white subtitles for spoken dialogue.\n\n**Audio:** Natural airport announcements, rolling suitcase wheels, trolley rattling, coffee splashing, surprised gasps, restrained laughter, footsteps, and authentic terminal ambience. No background music and no narration.\n\n**Important:** Keep all stunts harmless and comedic. No serious injuries, no graphic violence, no exaggerated cartoon physics, no character duplication, no face changes, no wardrobe changes, no distorted anatomy, no artificial CGI appearance, and no watermark.", "tweet_id": "2109995009948910050", "type": "tweet", "user_info": {"avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2043791038528331776/rcl0HoZd_normal.jpg", "cover_image": null, "created_at": "Thu Aug 22 09:34:46 +0000 2024", "description": null, "favorites_count": 67253, "followers_count": 14437, "friends_count": null, "location": "Los Angeles, CA", "name": "Smiling Khan", "rest_id": "1826553533128167425", "screen_name": "AIwithkhan", "url": null, "verified": true, "verified_type": null}, "views": "9525"}]}}]